      "id": "neuromancer-lore-sprawl",
      "categoryId": "neuromancer-lore-category-world",
      "title": "The Sprawl (BAMA)",
      "body": "The Boston-Atlanta Metropolitan Axis is an endless corridor of subways, ribbed freeways, and huddled towers where the underworld thrives.",
